\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"colorClass\":\"theme-palette3\",\"tabletAlign\":\"center\",\"fontHeight\":[null,\"\",\"\"]} -->\n<h3 class=\"kt-adv-heading30_936845-9d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading30_936845-9d\">Cuéntanos qué tipo de taquillas necesitas o el espacio que quieres equipar. Nuestro equipo te asesorará sin compromiso.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>En <strong>ZentryLockers</strong> fabricamos e instalamos taquillas metálicas resistentes y personalizadas para gimnasios, oficinas y empresas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Te ayudamos a elegir el modelo, color y configuración ideales para tu espacio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Completa el formulario y te responderemos en menos de 24 h con una propuesta adaptada a tus necesidades.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"id\":2,\"background\":\"palette9\",\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"borderRadius\":[5,5,5,5],\"uniqueID\":\"30_fc6a8f-a9\",\"padding\":[\"md\",\"md\",\"md\",\"md\"],\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column30_fc6a8f-a9\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:kadence/advancedheading {\"level\":3,\"uniqueID\":\"30_42c3a6-5d\",\"margin\":[\"\",\"\",\"sm\",\"\"],\"markBorder\":\"\",\"markBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"tabletMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"mobileMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"fontSize\":[16,\"\",\"\"],\"fontHeight\":[1,\"\",\"\"]} -->\n<h3 class=\"k